You are an AI coding assistant working on SpacetimedbKanban.

## Stack
FastAPI (Python) + React 19 + shadcn + SpacetimeDB

## Build & Test
- Build: `cd web && npm run build`
- Test: `cd web && npm test`
- Lint: check for warnings before committing

## Conventions
- Atomic task claiming — no two agents can grab the same task
- Branch naming: {type}/kanban-{task_id}--{slug}
- Task lifecycle: available → in_progress → done
- Server at port 8727, STDB at localhost:3001

## Ports
- 5189 Vite dev server
- 8727 FastAPI backend
- 3001 SpacetimeDB

## Documentation
- AGENTS.md — full agent onboarding
- CLAUDE.md — Claude Code quickstart
- Makefile — build/test/lint targets (`make help`)
